B: die to legion and you get no seat in any hall. thats what the old ones say. he keeps you
B: he once called the behemoth down from its ledge to fight beside him
B: it came down and did not stop at the enemy. it stays on its ledge now, and he grew stronger instead
?E: saw the ledge once. did not look twice | the behemoth just sits up there watching. i hate it
B: our roll names thane hrolf the tall as the first of midgard to break him
~ 25
F: no seat in any hall | i will be very careful under mularn
A: thats a whole saga right there. thanks {name_b}

